    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Native Table Builder is a powerful and flexible table builder block for creating any types of table with any content in Gutenberg Block Editor. Unlike traditional table plugins, Native Table allows you to insert any type of block content within table cells, giving you unlimited creative freedom. In additions, it comes with some missiong native blocks like Star Rating, SVG Icon, etc</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Flexible Content</strong>: Insert any Gutenberg block inside table cells</li>\n<li><strong>Easy Styling</strong>: Full control over table appearance and styling</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Layout</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Intuitive Interface</strong>: Simple drag-and-drop table creation</li>\n<li><strong>Performance Optimized</strong>: Lightweight and fast-loading</li>\n<li><strong>Pre Designed Patterns</strong>: Pre Designed patterns are ready to start fast.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br />\n<strong>Comparison tables</strong><br />\n<strong>Pricing tables</strong><br />\n<strong>Data tables</strong><br />\n<strong>Product showcases</strong><br />\n<strong>Pros and Cons</strong><br />\n<strong>Complex layouts requiring tabular structure</strong></p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>From WordPress Dashboard:</strong><br />\n1. Go to Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New<br />\n2. Search for &#8220;Native Table&#8221;<br />\n3. Click &#8220;Install Now&#8221; and then &#8220;Activate&#8221;</p>\n<p><strong>Manual Installation:</strong><br />\n1. Download the plugin zip file<br />\n2. Upload it via Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Upload Plugin<br />\n3. Activate the plugin</p>\n<p><strong>Usage:</strong><br />\n1. Create or edit a post/page<br />\n2. Click the &#8220;+&#8221; button to add a new block<br />\n3. Search for &#8220;Table Builder&#8221; or find it in the &#8220;Native Table&#8221; category<br />\n4. Star with pre-designed patterns or build a custom one</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20add%20any%20type%20of%20content%20to%20table%20cells%3F'>\nCan I add any type of content to table cells?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes! Native Table Builder allows you to insert any Gutenberg block inside table cells &#8211; text, images, buttons, lists, and even other complex blocks.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20the%20table%20responsive%3F'>\nIs the table responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Native Table is designed to be fully responsive and will adapt to different screen sizes automatically.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20style%20the%20table%3F'>\nCan I style the table?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely! The block includes comprehensive styling options for borders, colors, spacing, and more.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20my%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with my theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Native Table Builder is built using WordPress standards and should work with any properly coded theme. Just make sure the theme has Gutenberg support.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create flexible tables with any inner blocks as content in Gutenberg Editor",
    "description": "<p>Native Table Builder is a powerful and flexible table builder block for creating any types of table with any content in Gutenberg Block Editor. Unlike traditional table plugins, Native Table allows you to insert any type of block content within table cells, giving you unlimited creative freedom. In additions, it comes with some missiong native blocks like Star Rating, SVG Icon, etc</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Flexible Content</strong>: Insert any Gutenberg block inside table cells</li>\n<li><strong>Easy Styling</strong>: Full control over table appearance and styling</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Layout</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Intuitive Interface</strong>: Simple drag-and-drop table creation</li>\n<li><strong>Performance Optimized</strong>: Lightweight and fast-loading</li>\n<li><strong>Pre Designed Patterns</strong>: Pre Designed patterns are ready to start fast.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Perfect For:</strong><br />\n<strong>Comparison tables</strong><br />\n<strong>Pricing tables</strong><br />\n<strong>Data tables</strong><br />\n<strong>Product showcases</strong><br />\n<strong>Pros and Cons</strong><br />\n<strong>Complex layouts requiring tabular structure</strong></p>\n",
